      "body": "Dear list,\nIs that OK to just add up the results for mmpb(gb)sa (with entropy variable uncommented) and nab nmode entropy to get the delta G binding? e.g.,\nmmgbsa  ==> DELTA TOTAL                -52.8387\nnab nmode ==> DELTA S total=              -6.5050\nthen delta G binding = -46.3337\nMany thanks for your kind help.\nCheers,Siavoush",
